within ThermoSysPro.WaterSteam;

package Junctions "Junctions"
  extends ThermoSysPro.UsersGuide.Documentation.ThermoSysProPackageIcon;
  annotation(Documentation(info = "## Copyright © EDF 2002 - 2025

## ThermoSysPro Version 4.2

Junctions  


This sublibrary gathers cavities which volume is considered null.  
As such, junctions stand for static modeling.  
Mixers, splitters, static drum and steam dryer are available here.  

For a better understanding of the underlying physics of junctions, see Chap. 14 of :cite:`el19`.  



     

    "));
end Junctions;